# Docker reads the .dockerignore at the BUILD CONTEXT ROOT (the repo root, since
# the API is deployed with `fly deploy --dockerfile apps/api/Dockerfile` run from
# here). The apps/api/.dockerignore is NOT used for that build — this file is.
#
# Keep local-only and heavy paths out of the image: node_modules is reinstalled
# via `npm ci`, and secrets / local databases must never be baked into a layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
.git
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.claude
docs
